.TH swarm-key-recovery 1  "swarm 0.2.0" "Swarmgit manual"
.SH NAME
swarm\-key\-recovery \- Create a recovery key, name it in the repo, and save it to FILE (keep it offline)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBswarm key recovery\fR <\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR> [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIREPO\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a recovery key, name it in the repo, and save it to FILE (keep it offline)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<FILE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIREPO\fR>

